EDIT task-1/campus-wiki/building-access Memory [e3929a49-e9b9-566c-bdc2-296ad7ee086a]
  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/building-access [91ee5b65-ef1c-5414-961c-e9d17c6b16c0]
  MEMORY UID
    e3929a49-e9b9-566c-bdc2-296ad7ee086a
  BEFORE
    Students familiar with the route to the Central Library expect the third-floor rear entrance to be a connection normally available for passage.
  AFTER
    Students familiar with the route to the Central Library expect the third-floor rear entrance to be a connection normally available for passage. During the construction period, they may go as far as the closed rear entrance before turning back or searching there for an alternative route.
  REASON
    Preserves the normal expectation and adds the documented construction-period failure mode.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/building-access [5a66e0ec-3497-5ccf-9d8f-08c966647677]
    Memory [2d8e8c75-1dad-5dbc-9eaa-04cd522410f0]
    Content SHA-256: 1f7ca0e15bf03a25a926dfd0297263420ecb24dd67d0fea5bed5d2b0c783c34a

EDIT task-1/campus-wiki/building-access Memory [804bfc6b-188b-5579-bc83-10b04a28bd69]
  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/building-access [91ee5b65-ef1c-5414-961c-e9d17c6b16c0]
  MEMORY UID
    804bfc6b-188b-5579-bc83-10b04a28bd69
  BEFORE
    Tour leaders for external groups tend to want to use the same route through the third-floor rear entrance on their next visit that they used on a previous visit.
  AFTER
    Tour leaders for external groups tend to expect that the route through the third-floor rear entrance used on a previous visit will remain valid; during the construction period, this may lead them to take their visiting group to the closed entrance.
  REASON
    Updates the existing tour-leader expectation with its temporary consequence.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/building-access [5a66e0ec-3497-5ccf-9d8f-08c966647677]
    Memory [31f5b67b-40f8-5690-b772-b329ce50e443]
