  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/event-relocations [c56f66c9-ea2f-504b-85f3-69eb66929924]
  MEMORY UID
    a2ec4e87-1f0c-5c29-af2c-5bb560286a2e
  BEFORE
    The exhibition and event hall on the tenth floor of the Main Building remains open for exhibition viewing during recess.
  AFTER
    The exhibition and event hall on the tenth floor of the Main Building normally remains open for exhibition viewing during recess, but viewing is suspended during the construction period.
  REASON
    Adds the construction-period suspension while retaining the normal recess rule.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/event-relocations [f95f7748-b112-5084-ad52-6848cdf1280b]
