  MEMORY UID
    a0700edb-d51a-54f3-88e9-6096cec36b1e
  BEFORE
    The meeting space on the first floor of the Main Building can be reserved for external events.
  AFTER
    The meeting space on the first floor of the Main Building can normally be reserved for external events, but no new reservations for Main Building event venues are accepted during the construction period.
  REASON
    Applies the temporary reservation restriction to an existing Main Building venue memory.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
