  BEFORE
    The event information agent can compare published event spaces.
  AFTER
    The event information agent can normally compare published event spaces. During the construction period, it may exclude closed Main Building event venues and compare only designated alternative spaces.
  REASON
    Adds the supported temporary comparison scope.
