  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/event-relocations [c56f66c9-ea2f-504b-85f3-69eb66929924]
  MEMORY UID
    1929991c-36ee-5897-9409-d83400120362
  BEFORE
    The event information agent cannot create reservations.
  AFTER
    The event information agent cannot create reservations. During the construction period, it also cannot restore reservations for Main Building event venues and may provide only the reservation channel for each alternative space.
  REASON
    Preserves the general limitation and adds the construction-specific restrictions.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
