  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/event-relocations [c56f66c9-ea2f-504b-85f3-69eb66929924]
  MEMORY UID
    2a0f0a0e-1930-5983-9074-de449f8669d5
  BEFORE
    External visitors who have previously been to an event venue in the Main Building tend to look for the same entrance and floor they used on their previous visit when they visit again.
  AFTER
    External visitors who have previously attended an event in the Main Building tend to look for the same entrance and floor on a later visit; during the construction period, this expectation may cause them to miss guidance about the alternative venue.
  REASON
    Adds the documented relocation risk to the existing visitor expectation.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/event-relocations [f95f7748-b112-5084-ad52-6848cdf1280b]
