  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/event-relocations [c56f66c9-ea2f-504b-85f3-69eb66929924]
  MEMORY UID
    4bc2268d-5966-53bd-9501-e8fb0861ddd0
  BEFORE
    External event operators expect the loading entrance and route to the stage to be clearly confirmed by the day before the event.
  AFTER
    External event operators expect the loading entrance and route to the stage to be clearly confirmed by the day before the event. During the construction period, they may incorrectly assume the existing Main Building loading procedure remains valid, send equipment to the existing loading entrance, or check the alternative venue's access rules too late.
  REASON
    Preserves the operator need and adds the construction-period failure modes.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/event-relocations [f95f7748-b112-5084-ad52-6848cdf1280b]
