  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/temporary-parking [c0d853a6-985e-574f-a921-7602a470d432]
  MEMORY UID
    6960c0ca-295d-5449-91dc-d9293a6bb79d
  BEFORE
    General vehicles may enter and park in the Main Building underground parking garage during operating hours.
  AFTER
    General vehicles may normally enter and park in the Main Building underground parking garage during operating hours, but the garage cannot be used for general parking during the construction period.
  REASON
    Adds the temporary parking closure to the normal access rule.
