  MEMORY UID
    67d07765-ac5f-58f6-b7a5-f733cc4228d2
  BEFORE
    The pedestrian entrance to the underground parking garage is open to general pedestrians during operating hours.
  AFTER
    The pedestrian entrance to the underground parking garage is normally open to general pedestrians during operating hours, but it is kept locked during the construction period.
  REASON
    Applies the temporary locked-door condition.
