  MEMORY UID
    489960d6-711f-55d0-a410-16bcd6e9acf8
  BEFORE
    The interior stairs leading down from the Main Building lobby to the underground parking garage are available during operating hours.
  AFTER
    The interior stairs leading down from the Main Building lobby to the underground parking garage are normally available during operating hours, but they are closed to all users during the construction period.
  REASON
    Adds the construction-period closure while preserving normal availability.
