  BEFORE
    Outdoor Parking Lot C accepts visitor vehicles during posted operating hours.
  AFTER
    Outdoor Parking Lot C accepts visitor vehicles during posted operating hours and operates as the temporary alternative parking lot for vehicles visiting the Main Building during the construction period.
  REASON
