    Outdoor Parking Lot A to the left of the Main Building is connected to the Main Building underground parking garage by an inclined access road.
  AFTER
    Outdoor Parking Lot A to the left of the Main Building is connected to the Main Building underground parking garage by an inclined access road, but that road is blocked during the construction period.
  REASON
    Preserves the geographic connection and adds its temporary closure.
