  BEFORE
    The parking information agent can explain posted open statuses.
  AFTER
    The parking information agent can explain posted parking statuses and, during the construction period, may explain the closures of the underground garage and Outdoor Parking Lot A and the alternative use of Outdoor Parking Lot C.
  REASON
    Extends the existing agent capability with the specific posted construction information.
