  BEFORE
    The parking information agent cannot check real-time space availability.
  AFTER
    The parking information agent cannot check real-time space availability. During the construction period, it may explain the location of Outdoor Parking Lot C but cannot check or guarantee available spaces at the time of an inquiry.
  REASON
    Preserves and contextualizes the existing real-time availability limitation.
