  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/temporary-parking [c0d853a6-985e-574f-a921-7602a470d432]
  MEMORY UID
    3bd9a7e3-af83-5d3d-9cca-0a3926c446e1
  BEFORE
    First-time visiting drivers often expect there to be general parking spaces in the parking lot closest to the Main Building.
  AFTER
    First-time visiting drivers often expect general parking near the Main Building, and visitors accustomed to parking there may expect to enter the underground garage or Outdoor Parking Lot A during the construction period, drive as far as the closed access road, and only then search for Outdoor Parking Lot C.
  REASON
    Preserves the existing expectation and adds the supported construction-period behavior.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/temporary-parking [b392133c-278c-5c86-aaf9-5791ed5e9cd4]
