  MEMORY UID
    efbe330f-eb79-5a05-8ef8-0664355d320c
  BEFORE
    Delivery drivers and external maintenance providers sometimes expect to be able to load and unload briefly at the edge of Outdoor Parking Lot A.
  AFTER
    Delivery drivers and external maintenance providers sometimes expect to load or unload at the edge of Outdoor Parking Lot A. During the construction period, they may approach the same point and then have to reconfirm the delivery time or unloading location at the control line.
  REASON
    Adds the construction impact to the existing contractor expectation.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
