  MEMORY UID
    9e6dcc99-d2d7-54bd-adbf-ca20ebf22f83
  BEFORE
    The Campus Store on the first floor of the Main Building operates from 7:00 a.m. to 11:00 p.m. even during recess.
  AFTER
    The Campus Store on the first floor of the Main Building normally operates from 7 a.m. to 11 p.m. even during recess, but it is closed during the construction period.
  REASON
    Adds the temporary closure while preserving normal recess hours.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/shop-updates [94dbac4b-70b5-5c76-b53a-1ebc69248a41]
