  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/shop-updates [d1995b25-eefe-5353-8c23-0e0965e7a6ae]
  MEMORY UID
    3ecf1523-62fe-5bb1-be29-2b4a9b3384df
  BEFORE
    The Engineering Building Campus Store's usual operating hours during recess are from 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m.
  AFTER
    The Engineering Building Campus Store's usual recess hours are 9 a.m. to 6 p.m., but during the construction period it operates from 7 a.m. to 11 p.m.
  REASON
    Preserves ordinary recess hours and adds the construction-period schedule.
