  OWNER
    Context task-1/campus-wiki/shop-updates [d1995b25-eefe-5353-8c23-0e0965e7a6ae]
  MEMORY UID
    46192dec-18a4-5404-b3fe-5c0c42be97da
  BEFORE
    Students who need cash in the evening often expect that they can use the Main Building ATM at any time.
  AFTER
    Students who need cash in the evening often expect to use the Main Building ATM. During the construction period, they may come to the Main Building expecting to withdraw cash there and then have to find the West Complex ATM.
  REASON
    Adds the temporary relocation consequence to the existing user expectation.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
    1. Context task-1/participant/construction-updates/shop-updates [94dbac4b-70b5-5c76-b53a-1ebc69248a41]
