  MEMORY UID
    b0fa660c-d579-5c27-bf74-c9b3839fd36d
  BEFORE
    The amenities information agent can answer with posted locations.
  AFTER
    The amenities information agent can answer with posted locations. During the construction period, it may exclude the closed Main Building ATM, unattended store, Campus Store, and cafe from recommendations and provide guidance only to posted alternative facilities.
  REASON
