    Context task-1/campus-wiki/shop-updates [d1995b25-eefe-5353-8c23-0e0965e7a6ae]
  MEMORY UID
    39b4d014-8b9d-55ac-a5c2-ccc3e948a721
  BEFORE
    The Campus Store contractor incorporates students' tendency to use the Main Building ATM and the 24-hour store together in the evening into demand planning.
  AFTER
    The Campus Store contractor incorporates students' evening use of the Main Building ATM and 24-hour store into demand planning. Because Main Building facilities are closed during the construction period, the contractor operating the Engineering Building Campus Store may expect additional alternative users and seek to increase evening staffing and inventory above normal levels.
  REASON
    Preserves the demand-planning fact and adds the supported construction-period response.
