  BEFORE
    In summer, students prefer the air-conditioned indoor route from the first to the third floor of the Main Building over the outdoor route.
  AFTER
    In summer, students prefer the air-conditioned indoor route from the first to the third floor of the Main Building over the outdoor route. During the construction period, closure of that indoor route may impose substantial heat and travel burdens when they are redirected outdoors.
  REASON
    Preserves the route preference and adds the supported impact of its closure.
  SOURCE REFERENCES
